邃，反光清晰映出家具轮廓，暗部如浓墨、亮部泛着温润光泽）自然衔接；中景设 “三人低矮米白色软包沙发（边缘隐嵌古铜细条，靠背弧度贴合人体，坐垫填充高弹鹅绒，触感柔糯）+ 两把深棕暗纹织物扶手椅（实木大倾角斜撑椅腿，坐感包裹性强，面料带细微绒感，暗部纹理深邃）+ 圆形胡桃木茶几（桌面嵌黄铜圈，摆手工吹制玻璃花瓶插干枝，玻璃表面泛着朦胧光泽）”，家具间距适中显社交松弛感；后景浅木饰面墙衔接带暖光隐藏灯带的木质格栅天花（暖光如薄纱漫溢，暗部格栅纹理深沉、亮部柔光晕染），一根深灰天然石材柱（表面带山水状自然纹理，柱底嵌暖光云石灯，暗部纹理如墨色山水、亮部柔光漫溢）纵向分割空间，更远处大面积景观窗透出户外庭院绿植（强化大堂开阔通透明快感）；暖光镂空吊灯悬于中景上方，灯光透过镂空形成斑驳光影落于沙发，整体明暗对比强烈，深棕家具、深色石材暗部深邃沉静，暖光区域明亮聚焦，营造隐奢雅致的大堂会客氛围。", 1067, "randomize", "force_english"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "link": 47, "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}, {"widget": {"name": "advanced_options"}, "shape": 7, "name": "advanced_options", "label": "advanced_options", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "advanced_options"}], "flags": {}, "type": "RH_Translator", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [383.4130859375, 205.8053741455078], "pos": [2183.952392578125, 1942.994140625], "id": 50, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "RH_Translator"}, "order": 8}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "MODEL", "slot_index": 0, "links": [33, 34], "label": "MODEL", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "MODEL"}], "size": [315, 82], "pos": [2250, 1600], "widgets_values": ["civitai-model-778691-version-1769925-fluxmania_legacy.safetensors", "fp8_e4m3fn"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "unet_name"}, "name": "unet_name", "label": "unet_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "unet_name"}, {"widget": {"name": "weight_dtype"}, "name": "weight_dtype", "label": "weight_dtype", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "weight_dtype"}], "flags": {}, "id": 31, "type": "UNETLoader", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.54", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "UNETLoader"}, "order": 2}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "SAMPLER", "links": [30], "label": "SAMPLER", "type": "SAMPLER", "localized_name": "SAMPLER"}], "size": [315, 58], "pos